{"id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","title":"Directed Set","display":"df-directed-set — Directed Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-directed-set","aliases":["58-df-directed-set","Directed Set"],"display":"df-directed-set — Directed Set","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-directed-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-directed-set</span><span>Directed Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-directed-set — Directed Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (ZFC object variable; nonemptiness is asserted below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\">\\(\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\)</span> (preorder relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\)</span> (directed predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I i)\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I j\\land j\\leq_I k\\to i\\leq_I k)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I k\\land j\\leq_I k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I i)\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I j\\land j\\leq_I k\\to i\\leq_I k)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I k\\land j\\leq_I k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directed set: any two elements have a common upper bound; nets generalize sequences</li>\n<li>Net: function from directed set to topological space; converges via eventually condition</li>\n<li>Moore-Smith: nets replace sequences in general topological spaces</li>\n<li>Filters: equivalent to nets; filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> = directed set of neighborhoods of point</li>\n<li>Cofinality and supremum existence are downstream notions, not part of this definition atom.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kelley, General Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I i)\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I j\\land j\\leq_I k\\to i\\leq_I k)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq_I k\\land j\\leq_I k)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1243,"backlinks":[{"id":"3bb6eb53bb335d65","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"60906c78f1c2c236","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Directed}$ 取 [[../ba